  "created": "2026-04-15T16:42:40.33Z",
  "description": "\n    ThinkGeo.Printers targets .NET Framework 4.6.2+ and .NET Standard 2.1, compatible with modern .NET runtimes. It is a layer extension to the ThinkGeo product line that is used to design page layouts for maps. You can use this layer to layout the physical page to be printed.  This package integrates the following printer layers:\n\n    1. DataGridPrinter,\n    2. ImagePrinter,\n    3. LabelPrinter,\n    4. LegendPrinter,\n    5. MagneticDeclinationPrinter,\n    6. MapPrinter,\n    7. PagePrinter,\n    8. ScaleBarPrinter,\n    9. ScaleLinePrinter,\n    10. ScaleTextPrinter\n\n    Supported Platforms: Windows\n\n    ** This is an extension for use in ThinkGeo's product line, and cannot be used standalone.  **\n\n    Docs and Product Guides: https://docs.thinkgeo.com/\n\n    This is a commercial product with a free 30-day evaluation.\n    Start your evaluation by signing up at https://helpdesk.thinkgeo.com/register and downloading the ProductCenter application.\n\n    Other ThinkGeo Products based on .NET:\n    ThinkGeo.UI.Maui\n    ThinkGeo.UI.Android\n    ThinkGeo.UI.iOS\n    ThinkGeo.UI.Blazor\n    ThinkGeo.UI.Wpf\n    ThinkGeo.UI.WinForms\n    ThinkGeo.GisServer\n  ",
